SUMMARY:Craggy Pinnacle & Sunset along the Blue Ridge Pkwy
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nThis THOG day trip will in
 clude the rhododendron in bloom\, a hike up to Craggy Pinnacle\, and a sun
 set.\nThis type of trip is normally an overnight camping trip but due to H
 elene damage\, Crabtree Falls\, the Campground\, and that section of the B
 RP is still closed.\nStill\, I wanted to take advantage of seeing the rhod
 odendron during its normally peak time. So\, if you’re up for a day trip
 \, join me for a great trip to the Blue Ridge Parkway.\nWe’ll start in C
 hapel Hill\, form the carpools\, and drive 4hrs to Craggy Pinnacle. We may
  need a second driver.\n\nWe plan to drive home at sunset. Expect to retur
 n to the Triangle just after midnight Saturday night. Please share the cos
 t of gas with your driver.\n\nTRIP PARTICIPANT WAIVER OF LIABILITY I fully
  realize that this activity involves a risk of personal injury\, property 
 damage\, or loss of my person or property. I hereby for myself\, my heirs\
 , executors and administrators\, and same for persons with whom are in my 
 party\, waive and release any claims or rights against Triangle Hiking & O
 utdoors Group (THOG)\, all of its owners and coordinators for any and all 
 injury\, damages or loss to my person or property incurred during this act
 ivity. I also understand that THOG organizers are not required\, nor shoul
 d it be assumed that they are CPR/First Aid/Wilderness Survival Certified 
 and I am responsible for my own personal safety.\n\nIf you have any questi
 ons about this trip\, please comment below.\n-Larredo
