SUMMARY:Meeting for Maine Trip Participants Only
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\n**This meeting is only for
  those who have registered for the Acadia Nat'l Park trip in August. If yo
 u have not registered for that trip\, please complete your registration fo
 r that event in order to attend this meeting.**\n\n*Anyone who is not a pa
 rt of the Maine/Acadia Nat’l Park/Partial Solar Eclipse Event will have 
 their RSVP removed from this meeting event.*\n\nAcadia attendees\, please 
 RSVP for this important meeting. Feel free to order lunch while you're the
 re. We're very excited to have you all participating in the trip to Maine!
  The meeting will be held at Morgan Street Food Hall in downtown Raleigh a
 t 1:00PM. We should be done by 3:00PM. I want to get a head start on some 
 topics regarding this event since it'll be happening soon. We will be disc
 ussing some of the logistics involved as part of this trip\, as well as ca
 rpooling and the accommodations. Please try your best to attend.\n\n-Larre
 do
