SUMMARY:Backpacking San Juan Mts\, CO
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nThis is a five-day\, 42-mi
 le trip in Colorado's San Juan Mountains. We will start at Thirty Mile Tra
 ilhead\, thirty miles from Creede\, CO\, passing Grizzly Lake\, high peaks
 \, and a section of the Continental Divide National Scenic Trail. The trai
 lhead sits at 9\,500 ft elevation\, with the highest point reaching 12\,50
 0 ft just past the midpoint.\n\nThis trip will be non-competitive\, collab
 orative\, and fun. We won't be getting up at the crack of dawn to hit the 
 trail — morning coffee is one of the pleasures of backpacking. (There ma
 y be the occasional early start to get ahead of afternoon storms.) I carry
  a satellite communicator for emergencies.\n\nDates have some flexibility.
  If there is interest\, we can also coordinate rides from the Denver airpo
 rt.\n\nMessage me if you are interested.
